{ src: EXE 29C3:2ECF (copies 40 bytes x 200 rows, all planes through the latches (write mode 1), from
  SrcX + SrcY * stride to DstX + DstY * stride; the title copies the credits picture to the second page, row 200) }
{ interface }
{$F+} procedure CopyScreen(SrcX, SrcY, DstX, DstY: Integer); external; {$F-}
